<h2>Reset your password</h2>

<p>Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>, we received a request to reset your password.</p>

<p>Click the button below to choose a new password:</p>

<div class="btn-row">
  <a href="<%= resetUrl %>" class="btn">Reset Password</a>
</div>

<p class="muted-sm">Or copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
<p class="url-box"><%= resetUrl %></p>

<p class="muted">This link expires in <strong><%= ttlMinutes %> minutes</strong>.</p>

<p class="muted-sm">
  If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email - your password won't change.
</p>
